# Opinion: Learning in the &quot;Neural&quot; Organization.

**Authors:** Hutchin, Ted

## Abstract
Uses an analogy based on the neural networks of the mind to describe organizational communications channels and considers how the various structures within organizations can affect the learning process. The impact of neural organizations on the delivery of education and training is discussed, and examples from the Open University are given. (two references) (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ447545

